nk stripes, and pink-and-white sneakers.\n<Picture 1> is the character reference sheet for <Subject 1>, showing front, profile, and back views against a clean blue-to-cream gradient background.\n<Picture 2> is the character reference sheet for <Subject 2>, showing front, profile, and back views against a clean blue-to-cream gradient background.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second comedic claymation skit set in a private jet bedroom, using <Picture 1> and <Picture 2> as character references. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> lounge on a bed as she asks about her name, reveals it combines her parents' surnames, and asks him to call her \"mom\"; after landing, a captain approaches.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the short curly brown hair, green hoodie, denim shorts, white socks with green stripes, and green sneakers from <Picture 1> are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the brown ponytail with pink scrunchie, pink hoodie, denim shorts, white socks with pink stripes, and pink sneakers from <Picture 2> are retained.\n<Picture 1> (character design reference for <Subject 1>): weak_reference - used to lock the boy's appearance, not as a concrete frame anchor.\n<Picture 2> (character design reference for <Subject 2>): weak_reference - used to lock the woman's appearance, not as a concrete frame anchor.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a soft 3D felt-clay animation style with rounded character proportions, plush fabric textures, and a warm cinematic color palette. The setting is a compact luxury private-jet bedroom with cream leather walls, a small oval window showing twilight clouds, soft ambient cabin lights, and a neatly made bed.\n\n[Shot 1] An over-the-shoulder shot from behind <Subject 1>'s left shoulder frames <Subject 2> in sharp focus on the bed, <Subject 1>'s green hood softly blurred in the near foreground. <Subject 2> turns toward <Subject 1> with a playful tilt of her head, ponytail swaying, and asks in a light, teasing female voice (S1), <d>[Chinese] 我的名字好听吗。</d> The camera performs a slow push-in toward her face at small amplitude. <Subject 1>'s blurred profile nods slightly, and he answers in a calm young-boy voice (S2), <d>[Chinese] 好听。</d> A shallow depth of field keeps her expression tack-sharp while the bedroom walls melt into soft bokeh.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500, the shot cuts to a reverse angle over <Subject 2>'s shoulder, framing <Subject 1> in focus as the listener while she leans in from the blurred foreground. She explains in the same playful tone (S1), <d>[Chinese] 我爸爸的姓和我妈妈的姓拼在一起的，是不是很巧。</d> Midway through her line the camera racks focus from <Subject 1>'s attentive face to <Subject 2> in the foreground, ending the shot on her bright, proud smile. <Subject 1> responds with quiet sincerity (S2), <d>[Chinese] 我说我第一天就记住了。</d>\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot cuts to a side-profile medium close-up of the two figures against the cream leather wall. <Subject 2> reaches out and gently wraps her arms around <Subject 1>, pulling him into a warm side hug, her pink hoodie sleeve bunching softly around his shoulders. The camera arcs slowly around them from the side to a frontal angle at small amplitude and slow speed, keeping both faces in frame as she lowers her head near his ear and says in a sweet, conspiratorial voice (S1), <d>[Chinese] 以后别叫我景甜了，叫我妈妈吧。</d> The arc settles into a tight two-person close-up as <Subject 1> blinks, relaxes into the hug, and answers quietly (S2), <d>[Chinese] 好，妈妈。</d>\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:11.500, the shot cuts to a wide-angle view of the aisle just outside the bedroom, now clearly after landing with brighter cabin lights and the window showing an airport tarmac at dusk. In the blurred foreground, <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> are still visible mid-hug through the gap in the bedroom curtain, framed low in the near corner of the composition. A tall uniformed airline captain enters from the deep background on the left and walks toward the doorway along strong leading lines of the aisle, growing larger as he approaches. He stops at the curtain, and says in a calm professional male voice (S3), <d>[Chinese] 二位，已经落地了。</d> The focus snaps from the captain to the foreground couple as <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> freeze mid-embrace and slowly turn their heads toward him, holding an awkward silent stare through the final frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNo ambient sound, no background noise, and no music; only the clear, audible spoken dialogue of the characters is present.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [380, 350], "pos": [-1470, 6060], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 19}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [408.04349562300064, -4987.364413948146], "scale": 0.4950000000000027}}, "groups": [{"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Models", "bounding": [-1520, 4840, 522.1051635742188, 666.5789184570312]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Sampling", "bounding": [-360, 4840, 768.079833984375, 672.041259765625]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Conditionin